        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Heavy_Circles_by_Vasily_Kandinsky%2C_1927%2C_oil_on_canvas_-_Norton_Simon_Museum_-_Pasadena%2C_CA_-_DSC04139.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "image": {
